OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies and staff call for closed
OL,4,Aschool to reopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 parents, pupils and staff
OL,7,Fmembers have gathered outside a private
OL,8,Fschool following its sudden closure
OL,9,Fduring half term.
OL,11,FLeweston School, near Sherborne,
OL,12,FDorset, made the shock announcement on
OL,13,FTuesday that it would not reopen,
OL,14,Fleaving nearly 600 pupils without a
OL,15,Fplace.
OL,17,FConcept Education, whose subsidiary
OL,18,Fbought Leweston in December 2025,
OL,19,Fapologised to parents for its closure
OL,20,F"in such sudden and upsetting
OL,21,Fcircumstances" and said it was
OL,22,Fappointing a liquidator.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
